  "notes": "This is the second Neural Networks video on gradient descent and backpropagation. Major issues: NetworkScene and related neural network mobjects don't exist in CE. GraphScene doesn't exist in CE - must use axes and custom graphing. PiCreature API differs significantly. Helper functions need custom implementation. ImageMobject with pixel_array manipulation may work but needs testing. ContinualEdgeUpdate custom updater needs reimplementation with ValueTracker. ChangingDecimal and ChangingDecimalWithColor need custom implementation. The cost function visualization with 13,000 parameters is central to this video and needs careful implementation. The gradient descent visualization with single-variable and multi-variable cases is key. The training performance visualization and hidden layer weight interpretation are also critical."
